<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.35 pct by May 23.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.35 pct by May 23.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Tuesday liquidity in the bank system grew 0.35 percent or 69 million sucres to 19.63 billion sucres in the week to May 23.</p>
<p>At the end of April, bank liquidity stood at 19.25 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1996 at 16.99 billion sucres, up 35.8 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>((--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
